  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 622.01 Applicability. The public notice and hearing procedures specified in this part shall apply to:\n\n(a) All applications for the issuance, significant modification to, or renewal of title V operating permits filed with the department; and\n\n(b) All requests for title V permit reopenings.\n\nSource. #1710, eff 2-19-81; ss by #2332, eff 4-29-83; ss by 2938, eff 12-27-84; ss by #5033, eff 12-27-90; ss by #6057-B, eff 6-30-95; EXPIRED: 6-30-03\n\nNew. #8129, eff 7-28-04 (formerly Env-A 206.01); ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
